  "一般組分 3 個招生群類 + 青年儲蓄帳戶組 2 名；設計群 205036（21+1 名）是動遊系最大入學管道。": "General track divided into 3 admission groups + Youth Savings Account track with 2 places; Design Group 205036 (21+1 places) is the largest admission pathway for AGD.",
  "四技日間部甄選入學 — 透過聯合招生，採統測 + 校系自辦指定項目甄試的入學管道。 115學年度一般組：高職等專業群科畢業生不限應屆；普通科畢業滿1年，或符合簡章同等學力等資格者也可申請。綜高應屆須截至高三上修畢專門學程25學分。普通科應屆原則不適用；若截至高三上跨選專業群科或專門學程達25學分或450小時，依簡章另核。須取得115統測成績，且符合群類、校系及其他資格限制；青年儲蓄帳戶組另核。 樹德動遊系一次開出 4 個招生代碼（一般組 3 群 + 青年儲蓄帳戶組），115學年度甄選入學最多可申請6個校系科（組）、學程，各校得另限制可報名該校的系科數；請依當年簡章核對。 錄取流程： 1. 統測成績進入第一階段篩選 2. 通過篩選者上傳第二階段備審資料 3. 第二階段甄試到校 — 書審 + 面試 + 實作（設計群） 4. 公告總成績 + 正備取名單 5. 登記就讀志願序 → 統一分發 → 報到 須備：學習歷程檔案、作品集（設計群）、自傳、讀書計畫": "Four-Year College Day Division Selection-Based Admission (甄選入學) — An admission pathway through joint admissions based on TCTE + department-administered designated examinations.\n\nGeneral group, Academic Year 115: Eligible graduates and graduating students of vocational/professional programs, general-track high school graduates who graduated at least one year ago, and applicants meeting the guide’s equivalent-qualification or other eligibility provisions may apply. Graduating comprehensive high school students must have completed 25 credits in a specialized program by the end of the first semester of their final year. Current-year general-track graduates are generally ineligible; those who have completed 25 credits or 450 hours of cross-enrolled vocational/professional or specialized-program courses by that semester require separate assessment under the guide. Applicants must have AY 115 TCTE scores and meet examination-category, program and other eligibility restrictions. The Youth Savings Account group has separate requirements.\n\nShu-Te AGD offers 4 admission codes at once (3 general groups + Youth Savings Account group); for Academic Year 115, applicants may apply to at most six departments, divisions or degree programs in total. Individual universities may impose their own per-university limit; check that year’s official guide.\n\nAdmission Process:\n1. TCTE scores enter Stage 1 screening\n2. Those who pass screening upload Stage 2 review documents\n3. Stage 2 on-campus examination — documentary review + interview + practical test (Design Group)\n4. Announcement of total scores + admitted/waitlisted lists\n5. Registering department preferences → centralized placement → registration\n\nRequired: Student Learning Portfolio, portfolio (Design Group), autobiography, study plan",
