  "限應屆高職 / 綜合高中畢業生，校內遴選推薦制。": "Restricted to graduating seniors from vocational / comprehensive high schools; school internal recommendation system.",
  "科技校院繁星計畫 — 由就讀學校依在校成績推薦，不採計統測的學校推薦制管道。 適用對象：應屆高職 / 綜合高中畢業生 申請資格： ● 限國內公立或已立案私立高級中等學校（高職、綜合高中）的應屆畢業生 ● 全程就讀國內同一學校 ● 在校學業成績總平均排名百分比須符合招生簡章規定的標準 申請流程重點： ● 學校推薦制 — 學生無法以個人名義報名，請洽就讀學校註冊組或輔導室 ● 已報名「大學繁星推薦」（高中管道）者，不得重複報名「科技繁星」 ● 主要依在校學業成績總平均排名百分比進行比序": "Star Program for Vocational Colleges (科技校院繁星計畫) — A school recommendation pathway based on academic rankings without taking TCTE scores into account.\n\nTarget Audience: Graduating seniors from vocational high schools / comprehensive high schools\n\nEligibility Requirements:\n● Restricted to graduating seniors from domestic public or accredited private senior high schools (vocational high schools, comprehensive high schools)\n● Enrolled in the same domestic school throughout high school\n● Overall GPA percentile rank must meet the standards specified in the admissions prospectus\n\nApplication Process Key Points:\n● School recommendation system — Students cannot register individually; please contact your school's registration office or counseling office\n● Those who have already registered for University Star Program (大學繁星推薦) (academic high school pathway) may not register for the Star Program for Vocational Colleges (科技繁星)\n● Order of priority is primarily based on overall academic GPA percentile ranking",
  "🏫 校內遴選由就讀高職 / 綜合高中辦理 — 請洽就讀學校註冊組或輔導室": "🏫 Internal selection is conducted by your vocational / comprehensive high school — Please consult your school's registration section or counseling office",
