  "競賽優勝、採認證照等資格甄審（115學年度85商設類別；依當年簡章）。": "Selection based on eligible competition awards or recognized credentials (AY 115, Category 85 Commercial Design; subject to that year’s guide).",
  "技優甄審入學 — 依115學年度簡章審查技藝技能競賽優勝、採認證照等資格的入學管道。 適用對象：符合當年簡章學歷與資格規定者，不只限應屆畢業生。可採認的資格包括競賽優勝、勞動部乙級（含）以上技術士證等；證照職（種）類與招生類別須符合簡章，並非持任一乙級證照即可報名本系。 錄取流程： 1. 第一階段：報名 + 繳費 + 上傳當年簡章要求的資格證明 / 作品集 2. 第二階段：書面審查（樹德動遊系不含現場實作） 3. 公告甄審結果 → 登記志願序 → 統一分發 → 報到": "Skill-Excellence Screening Admission (技優甄審入學) — Selection based on eligible competition awards, recognized credentials and other qualifications specified in the Academic Year 115 guide.\n\nEligibility: Applicants must meet that year’s education and qualification requirements; eligibility is not limited to current-year graduates. Recognized qualifications include eligible competition awards and Class B or higher technician certificates issued by Taiwan’s Ministry of Labor. The certificate trade and admission category must match the guide; holding any Class B certificate does not automatically qualify someone to apply to AGD.\n\nAdmission Process:\n1. Stage 1: Registration + fee payment + uploading the qualification documents required by that year’s guide / portfolio\n2. Stage 2: Documentary review (Shu-Te AGD does not include on-site practical test)\n3. Announcement of screening results → Preference ranking registration → Centralized placement → Registration",
  "📜 依115簡章審查競賽優勝、勞動部乙級（含）以上技術士證等資格；須符合招生職種與類別。": "📜 AY 115 eligibility includes recognized competition awards, Ministry of Labor Class B or higher technician certificates and other listed qualifications; the trade and admission category must meet the guide.",
  "🎯 16 名名額 — 是樹德動遊系第二大入學管道": "🎯 16 places quota — The second largest admission pathway for Shu-Te AGD",
  "📋 上傳備審截止 6/9 21:00；甄審費可至 6/9 24:00": "📋 Document upload deadline: 6/9 21:00; screening fee payable until 6/9 24:00",
