  "以 1980 年代懷舊美術風格呈現偶像崇拜與理性認知的衝突，融入 SDG 4「優質教育」與 SDG 12「負責任消費與生產」。國際影展入圍提名累計 13 項，橫跨西、土、美、印、阿聯、日、義 7 國。": "Presenting the conflict between idol worship and rational cognition in a 1980s nostalgic art style, integrating SDG 4 \"Quality Education\" and SDG 12 \"Responsible Consumption and Production.\" Accumulated 13 international film festival selections and nominations across 7 countries: Spain, Turkey, USA, India, UAE, Japan, and Italy.",
