  "業師組成涵蓋影像、動畫、品牌、工作室創業、虛擬角色等領域；張純雅老師主持的「設計師工作室」課程已成為跨年度業師輪訓的核心場域。": "Industry mentors span fields such as film, animation, branding, studio entrepreneurship, and virtual characters; the 'Designer Studio' course led by teacher Chang Chun-ya (張純雅) has become the core venue for multi-year industry mentor co-teaching rotations.",
