  "學海築夢與 Hautecouture 株式會社的合作已邁入第 9 屆。海外實習配合學校國際交流獎助學金 + 教育部補助，學生實際支出大幅降低。": "The collaboration between Xuehai Dream Project and hautecouture Inc. has entered its 9th cohort (some older documents mention Year 5 / Year 8; updated based on 2026 data). Combined with the university's international exchange scholarships and Ministry of Education subsidies, students' actual expenses for overseas internships are substantially reduced. (學海築夢與 Hautecouture 株式會社的合作已邁入第 9 屆 - 部分舊文件提到第 5 年 / 第 8 年，依 2026 年度資料更新)",
  "系榮譽事蹟 · 完整年表": "Department Honors and Achievements · Complete Chronology",
  "2011-2026 · 連載 16 年的得獎紀錄": "2011–2026 · 16 years of award records",
  "從 2011 年至今，動遊系學生作品在國內外設計、動畫、遊戲競賽連續發光。橫跨放視大賞、巴哈姆特 ACG、金點新秀、青春設計節、時報金犢獎、KT 科藝獎，到法國、韓國、印度、義大利、土耳其、美國、西班牙、立陶宛等多個國際影展。": "From 2011 to present, student works from the Department of Animation and Game Design have continuously shone in domestic and international design, animation, and game competitions. Spanning Vision Get Wild, Bahamut ACG, Young Pin Design Award, Youth Innovative Design Festival, Times Young Creative Awards, and K.T. Creativity Award, to international film festivals across France, South Korea, India, Italy, Turkey, the United States, Barcelona, Lithuania, and more.",
