  "全台指標性數位內容競賽「2025 放視大賞」共 8 件畢業製作入圍。 動畫類 5 部：《失竊的祕方》、《人造人》、《癡迷的現實》、《妖夢》、《神癒》 遊戲類 3 部：《糖霧之謎》、《眼及之處》、《Trace》": "A total of 8 graduation capstone projects were shortlisted in Taiwan's benchmark digital content competition, 2025 Vision Get Wild (2025 放視大賞).\n\nAnimation Category (5 works): The Stolen Recipe (《失竊的祕方》), Android (《人造人》), Obsessive Reality (《癡迷的現實》), Phantom Dream (《妖夢》), Divine Healing (《神癒》)\nGame Category (3 works): Mystery of Sugar Mist (《糖霧之謎》), As Far as the Eye Can See (《眼及之處》), Trace",
  "蘇中和教授 · 全球前 2% 頂尖科學家": "Professor Su Zhong-he (蘇中和) · World's Top 2% Scientists",
  "連四年榮登": "Listed for 4 Consecutive Years (連四年榮登)",
  "學術榮譽": "Academic Honor",
  "蘇中和教授（動遊系）": "Professor Su Zhong-he (蘇中和) (AGD Department)",
  "連續四年入選《全球前 2% 頂尖科學家》（World's Top 2% Scientists）": "Selected for four consecutive years in the World's Top 2% Scientists (《全球前 2% 頂尖科學家》)",
  "代表性論文單篇引用次數已超過數千次": "A representative paper has amassed thousands of citations",
  "在教育研究領域名列全球前 2% 頂尖水準": "Ranked within the world's top 2% in the field of education research",
  "蘇中和教授（副校長暨設計學院院長）連續四年入選《全球前 2% 頂尖科學家》（World's Top 2% Scientists），代表性論文單篇引用次數已超過數千次，在教育研究領域名列全球前 2% 頂尖水準。 研究範疇涵蓋設計教育、遊戲化 STEM 教育、數位雙生與擴增實境設計，並成功跨足智慧設計與 AI 影像處理。": "Professor Su Zhong-he (蘇中和) (Vice President and Dean of the College of Design) has been selected for four consecutive years in the World's Top 2% Scientists (《全球前 2% 頂尖科學家》), with a representative paper cited thousands of times, ranking among the world's top 2% in the field of education research.\n\nHis research scope encompasses design education, gamified STEM education, digital twins, and augmented reality design, while successfully expanding into intelligent design and AI image processing.",
