  "我適合哪個入學管道？": "WHICH ADMISSIONS PATHWAY FITS ME?",
  "3 題 · 第": "3 QUESTIONS · QUESTION",
  "科技繁星限應屆高職／綜合高中，而且已報名大學繁星推薦就不能重複報名科技繁星；普通型高中建議走申請入學。": "Technical Star is for current vocational or comprehensive high-school graduates. Applicants to the university Star program cannot also apply to Technical Star; general high-school students should consider application-based admission.",
  "技優甄審不限競賽獲獎的高職應屆生；115學年度也採認符合簡章職種的勞動部乙級（含）以上技術士證等資格。高中、非應屆等身分須依當年簡章核對，不可只憑身分判定可否報名。": "Skill-excellence selection is not limited to current vocational high-school graduates with competition awards. The AY 115 guide also recognizes eligible Ministry of Labor Class B or higher technician certificates and other listed qualifications. General high-school and non-current-year applicants must check that year’s guide; school type alone does not establish eligibility.",
  "申請入學的適用對象是高中應屆畢業生（持學測成績）；高職／綜合高中的主力是統測相關管道。": "Application-based admission is for current high-school graduates with GSAT results. Vocational and comprehensive high-school students usually use vocational examination pathways.",
  "115 學年度科技繁星錄取生，不論是否放棄，均不得參加當年度四技二專甄選入學；其他管道請依各招生簡章與報到／放棄規定辦理。": "Students admitted through the Academic Year 115 Technical Star program may not participate in that year’s Four-Year/Two-Year Selection-Based Admission (四技二專甄選入學), whether or not they give up their place. For other pathways, follow each guide and its registration and withdrawal rules.",
