  "不同入學年與班別分開核對；有缺項就找系辦確認補修或認列。": "Check the rules for your entry year and program. Ask the department about making up or recognizing anything missing.",
  "這是開始實習前的準備；實習中怎麼聯絡老師、結束後交什麼，也請先問清楚。": "These are preparations before starting an internship. Also ask how to contact your supervisor during it and what to submit afterward.",
  "畢業認列與獎助是兩件事；獎助須另查當期資格及期限。": "Graduation recognition and awards are separate. Check the current eligibility and deadline for awards.",
  "有考試、較長假期或緊急狀況，先向承辦確認另外要辦的事。": "If exams, extended leave or an emergency are involved, ask the responsible office about additional procedures.",
  "選課成功與課程異動都要再查；已截止的時程不代表仍可補選。": "Recheck both registration and course changes. A past schedule does not mean late registration is still available.",
  "先核對可申請身分與當期期限；初審後的加退選要自己辦，不等最後核定才處理。": "Check your eligibility and the current deadline first. Make course changes yourself after the initial review; do not wait for the final decision.",
  "分組、審查日期、作品格式與展演要求，先取得當屆文件再排進度。": "Get your cohort’s documents before planning groups, review dates, work formats and exhibition requirements.",
  "英文課程學分與英文能力門檻要分開確認；分級免修也要問清楚補足方式。": "Check English course credits separately from proficiency requirements. If placement exempts you from a course, ask how to make up the required credits.",
  "依目前狀況選一項；役男的緩徵或儘後召集另外向生輔組確認。": "Choose what fits your situation. Students subject to military service must separately check deferment or reserve-call arrangements with Student Life Guidance.",
  "休學與復學依目前狀況擇一辦理；役男另向生輔組確認兵役，不以完成學籍程序代替。": "Apply for leave or return according to your situation. Students subject to military service must also check with Student Assistance Section; academic-status procedures do not replace military-service procedures.",
  "急難慰助、助學金與學雜費減免各有資格和期限，先請承辦協助選方案。": "Emergency relief, student aid and tuition reductions have different conditions and deadlines. Ask the office to help identify the right scheme.",
  "依需求直接找窗口，不必先諮商才能提出權益問題。": "Contact the appropriate office directly. Counseling is not a prerequisite for raising a rights issue.",
  "可同步找師長討論與使用職發資源，依各職缺要求準備作品。": "You can consult teachers and use Career Services at the same time. Prepare your work for each position’s requirements.",
  "本校與外校各看自己的簡章；送出後仍要查資格審查與補件狀態。": "Check each university’s own admission guide. After submission, keep checking eligibility review and requests for additional documents.",
  "海外實習的甄選、補助與出國文件分開確認；歷屆成果不代表本期已開放。": "Check overseas internship selection, funding and travel documents separately. Past achievements do not mean applications are currently open.",
  "見學、交換與海外實習的申請和補助不同，依正在招募的團或課程辦理。": "Study visits, exchanges and overseas internships have different applications and funding. Follow the group or course currently recruiting.",
  "到系統填寫申請並印出紙本": "Complete the online application and print it",
  "送請開課單位與就讀系所主管初審": "Request initial review by the course unit and your department heads",
  "依初審結果自行辦理加退選": "Make course changes yourself based on the initial review",
  "將申請表及證明交註冊課務組": "Submit the form and evidence to Registration and Curriculum Division",
  "回到系統查詢核定結果": "Return to the system to check the final decision",
  "先確認申請身分與當期截止日，再到校務系統填寫並印表。備妥原校歷年成績單正本及適用的證明，一次整理齊全。": "Check your eligibility and the current deadline, then complete and print the form in the university system. Prepare the original transcript from your previous institution and any applicable evidence together.",
  "把申請資料交給開課單位與自己就讀的系所主管審查。哪些課程可以抵免，先依這個初審結果確認。": "Submit your documents to the heads of the course-offering unit and your own department. Use the initial review to check which courses may receive credit.",
  "初審通過的課程如果仍在課表裡，要自行處理退選；也一起確認需要補選哪些課。不要等最後核定後才開始處理。": "If a course approved at the initial review is still on your timetable, drop it yourself and check what you need to add. Do not wait for the final decision to start making changes.",
  "依規定把經初審的申請表與證明資料交到教務處註冊課務組。資料請一次備齊，送件仍須在當期受理期間內完成。": "Submit the initially reviewed form and evidence to Registration and Curriculum Division as required. Prepare all documents together and submit them within the current application period.",
  "送件後回校務系統查詢最後核定情形，再與自己的課表及畢業檢核核對。有落差時，帶結果找註冊課務組確認。": "After submission, check the final decision in the university system and compare it with your timetable and graduation check. Bring any discrepancies to Registration and Curriculum Division.",
  "休學：先聯繫系所，再到教務處領表": "Leave of absence: contact your department, then collect the form",
  "復學或續休：依通知回覆並辦理": "Return or extended leave: reply and proceed as notified",
  "兵役：另向生輔組確認資料": "Military service: check separately with Student Assistance Section",
  "先約好導師或系所承辦，再到註冊課務組登記領表。依當期公告完成訪談、離校與交回文件；領表日期會影響退費計算。": "Arrange a time with your adviser or department office, then register and collect the form from Registration and Curriculum Division. Complete the interviews, clearance and document return as announced; the form-collection date affects refund calculations.",
  "收到復學通知後，依通知期限回覆復學或繼續休學，確認下一學期的註冊安排。若因服役辦理休復學，另問註冊課務組需要哪些證明。": "When you receive a return notice, reply by its deadline to return or extend your leave, and confirm next semester’s registration. If military service is involved, ask Registration and Curriculum Division which evidence is required.",
  "轉入、復學或延畢等學籍有變動時，另向生輔組確認兵役資料及緩徵或儘後召集是否要辦理。不要把學籍手續視為兵役也已完成。": "When transferring, returning or extending your studies, check your military-service records and any deferment or reserve-call procedures separately with Student Assistance Section. Completing academic-status procedures does not complete military-service procedures.",
  "教務處抵免學分：115-1申請程序": "Academic Affairs: credit-transfer procedure for 115-1",
